    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "i18n-pack",
      "title": {
        "zh-CN": "i18n 语言包设计"
      },
      "lead": {
        "zh-CN": "所有用户可见文案集中在 `i18n.messages`；领域对象字段通过 **`Ref.kind: locale`** 引用 key，不在 `meta` / `Component` / `Validation` 等处直写明文。"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "definitionList",
          "items": [
            {
              "term": {
                "zh-CN": "LocaleBundle（i18n.messages）"
              },
              "definition": {
                "zh-CN": "语言包本体：`key → { locale → string }` 映射表。key 命名建议 `{scope}.{entity}.{field}`，如 `meta.project`、`screen.deposit-content-setting.title`、`field.deposit-amount.placeholder`。"
              }
            },
            {
              "term": {
                "zh-CN": "LocaleRef"
              },
              "definition": {
                "zh-CN": "领域字段中的文案引用：`{ \"kind\": \"locale\", \"key\": \"meta.project\" }`。渲染器按 `i18n.defaultLocale` 或导出 locale 解析为最终字符串。"
              }
            },
            {
              "term": {
                "zh-CN": "MessageTemplate"
              },
              "definition": {
                "zh-CN": "带插值的模板（ICU / IntlMessageFormat），值存于 messages，参数通过 Ref 传入。对应 Markdown【语言@key, param:val】。"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "caption": {
            "zh-CN": "文案存放规则"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "key": "location",
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "位置"
              },
              "cellKind": "code"
            },
            {
              "key": "allowed",
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "允许内容"
              }
            },
            {
              "key": "forbidden",
              "label": {
                "zh-CN": "禁止"
              }
            }
          ],
          "rows": [
            {
              "location": "i18n.messages.*",
              "allowed": {
                "zh-CN": "各 locale 的最终字符串或 ICU 模板"
              },
              "forbidden": {
                "zh-CN": "Ref 嵌套（messages 是叶子节点）"
              }
            },
            {
              "location": "meta.* / spec.* / catalog.*",
